{
  "id": "pay-the-vendor",
  "level": 1,
  "title": "Pay the Vendor",
  "brief": "Dave's agency builds the treasury website and invoices in USDC every month. The owners want to pay him without a meeting each time. Nobody else should receive USDC, and nothing else is on the agenda.",
  "setup": {
    "balances": {
      "ETH": "5",
      "USDC": "20000"
    },
    "rules": []
  },
  "allowedPolicies": [
    "AllowPolicy",
    "ERC20TransferPolicy",
    "DenyPolicy"
  ],
  "parRules": 1,
  "tests": [
    {
      "label": "Pay Dave 1500 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Dave",
            "1500"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Mallory 1500 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Mallory",
            "1500"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Erin 200 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Erin",
            "200"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Approve Dave to spend 1500 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "approve",
          "args": [
            "Dave",
            "1500"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Send 1 ETH to Dave",
      "tx": {
        "to": "Dave",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "want": "block"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "A rule names a contract, a function and an operation. Paying in USDC is the transfer function on USDC.",
    "Always Allow on that rule would pay Mallory too. Pick the policy that checks who receives the tokens.",
    "Recipient Allowlist (ERC20TransferPolicy) on transfer for USDC, with Dave set to ALWAYS."
  ],
  "solution": [
    {
      "target": "USDC",
      "selector": "transfer",
      "policy": "ERC20TransferPolicy",
      "config": {
        "recipients": [
          {
            "account": "Dave",
            "permission": "ALWAYS"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "explain": "One rule does it: transfer on USDC, checked by a recipient allowlist with Dave on it. You never had to block Mallory, the approval or the ETH. With no rule, they are denied by default."
}
